{"id":"963f340ca3df3668aa219e683f8e704ba8922f8f13d2e3d886ed7e32a13ad5c1","pubkey":"d7a8847111e0448ad52383a62196c0e99ed0918bb0f29a1199a4c9c8e6f96b0c","created_at":1782501543,"content":"🛸 TRANSMISSION 004\n\n$BLEEP - Episode 4: THE MEME WAR is now live.\n\nAfter discovering #Bitcoin and learning about Proof of Work, nostr:nprofile1qqsd02yywyg7q3y2653c8f3pjmqwn8ksjx9mpu56zxv6fjwgumukkrqpyfmhxue69uhhyetvv9ujucn9va5kumnfdenk2mny9e3k7mf00pjkummwqyt8wumn8ghj7un9d3shjtnswf5k6ctv9ehx2aqswq07x has uncovered something even stranger...\n\nMemes.\n\nThe smallest unit of cultural information.\n\nWhy do humans create them?\nWhy do they spread?\nAnd could they somehow be connected to the signal?\n\n📺 Watch Episode 4:\nhttps://rumble.com/v7aizf2-bleep-episode-4-the-meme-war.html\n\nNew here?\n\nStart your investigation from the beginning by watching the transmission archive:\n\n001 - THE SIGNAL\n002 - THE CONFERENCE\n003 - PROOF OF WORK\n\n(Links in the comments ⬇️)\n\nthe signal is growing\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/3781fc52ddef1b485ee9de365ecc75f48605f8173a5160bd68d1765f71a99885.mp4","tags":[["t","Bitcoin"]]}
