{"id":"017b164cc5001e4d8184af76698842860c90319d285ae269c74f03eff1c35e3f","pubkey":"ee6ea13ab9fe5c4a68eaf9b1a34fe014a66b40117c50ee2a614f4cda959b6e74","created_at":1782499512,"content":"Sidecar 🍸 was tested extensively with nostr:npub1xxdd8eusvdxmaph3fkuu9x2mymhrcc3ghe2l38zv0l4f4nqp659qskkt7a and several other clients including Jumble and Primal over the past week.\n\nIf you find any issues, please report them here:\nhttps://github.com/dmnyc/sidecar/issues\nnostr:nevent1qvzqqqqqqypzpmnw5yatnljuff5w47d35d87q99xddqpzlzsac4xzn6vm22ekmn5qyghwumn8ghj7mn0wd68ytnvv9hxgtcpzemhxue69uhkummnw3ex2mrfw3jhxtn0wfnj7qpqk2x6e4mkzhqsygwykj9g5qgndn363s9tpt82qej5qdprx9kqftzqa777wq\nhttps://i.nostr.build/F1ASJsZaHsXVkHI5.jpg https://i.nostr.build/1P2vRrgQsIDCP64j.jpg https://i.nostr.build/rj5Tye04BLb2Atd8.jpg https://i.nostr.build/LPPjUPUqiNWQyznH.jpg https://i.nostr.build/zsioVoDKkBSu0YV7.jpg https://i.nostr.build/muMDJI6IxeqZqJ0s.jpg","tags":[["t","zapcooking"],["p","319ad3e790634dbe86f14db9c2995b26ee3c6228be55f89c4c7fea9acc01d50a"],["client","Zap Cooking"],["e","b28dacd77615c10221c4b48a8a01136ce3a8c0ab0acea0665403423316c04ac4","wss://nostr.land/","mention"],["p","ee6ea13ab9fe5c4a68eaf9b1a34fe014a66b40117c50ee2a614f4cda959b6e74"]]}
