{"id":"94ed37c220b3701ba93103cafeb1ac56fca9dacadb31659666dd5a87d0501ab1","pubkey":"d28413712171c33e117d4bd0930ac05b2c51b30eb3021ef8d4f1233f02c90a2b","created_at":1782499072,"content":"LLM'd it, as it did in fact seem to show r^5 factor which would mean increasing over distance, and here's what I got. Appears there's a typo. Nice catch by reply\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/6c62ce631960eaad3addbf9f572709c819704040556adcbaf7ed90b4deff4448.png","tags":[["e","0e0789dd08883c6f2d31e45430468df1ffe6c6d27cc8ded6dfab90f0531e9fc0","wss://relay.snort.social/","root","036533caa872376946d4e4fdea4c1a0441eda38ca2d9d9417bb36006cbaabf58"],["e","000004e47a8e492e49e11a229791a1109286e4a87f51bd28f7cf4b41e9a99775","wss://relay.primal.net/","reply","010df0c948fe9ab54d2cb7ea420ffa08d57958981b6ea68e83aaa7eb2dd3f05a"],["p","036533caa872376946d4e4fdea4c1a0441eda38ca2d9d9417bb36006cbaabf58"],["p","010df0c948fe9ab54d2cb7ea420ffa08d57958981b6ea68e83aaa7eb2dd3f05a"]]}
{"id":"b28dacd77615c10221c4b48a8a01136ce3a8c0ab0acea0665403423316c04ac4","pubkey":"ee6ea13ab9fe5c4a68eaf9b1a34fe014a66b40117c50ee2a614f4cda959b6e74","created_at":1782498906,"content":"Hey Nostr! I built a thing for you. 💜⚡️🖖\n\nSidecar 🍸 A Classy Nostr Signer\n\nSidecar is a multi-account Nostr signer and Lightning wallet that lives in your browser’s sidebar. It uses NIP-07 and NWC.\n\nAdd as many profiles as you want and pick which apps each have access to. Keys stay on your device, backups encrypt to your own key so you can restore on another browser.\n\nEdit your profile, post, and zap directly from the side panel.\n\nJust got approved for testing on the Chrome Web Store. Try it out and let me know what you think!\n\nhttps://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/sidecar-a-classy-nostr-si/moimlikilhheabdafocpmneehpblhiln\nhttps://i.nostr.build/dCw8IUBPtzWfAuk8.jpg https://i.nostr.build/RCw8dIb4ke8n0jfL.jpg","tags":[["client","Sidecar 🍸","https://github.com/dmnyc/sidecar","wss://relay.damus.io"]]}
