{"id":"57b2b0547767aff743cfad81bfd7dbf8a2845a2d6abf935b91fee6eb36146bac","pubkey":"bc02e0a6c0f01ad9cb57a2b0f8ef8241bc5ff979ce4452ce9e243de457756725","created_at":1782489440,"content":"There's lots of good guides online. If you want an amateur guide from me you can find it here: https://www.kamresearch.global/meshtastic/ and thank you to nostr:nprofile1qqsd846pynwlkk7uvxu0rrghcve4hw6033c3s234acnnzjjf5n4hk8gpr9mhxue69uhhqun9d45h2mfwwpexjmtpdshxuet59uq32amnwvaz7tmjv4kxz7fwv3sk6atn9e5k7tcpzamhxue69uhhyetvv9ujuurjd9kkzmpwdejhgtc5nmks7 for coming down to teach us!\n\nI would recommend doing it as a group because then you'll for sure have someone to test devices with. Usually HAM radio clubs have crossover in LoRa mesh radio. \n\nFor devices you can build your own or get them premade. I like my T-Deck but I wish I had spent a bit more. I got the cheapest china crap and it took two months to get and the battery's a pos. So you get what you pay for 🤣\n\nLet me know if you have any questions it's been fun to get into 🥰","tags":[["alt","A short note: There's lots of good guides online. If you want an..."],["e","b45de0f2e989ba0442830a1eaa00735362e9ffb399fce84f136360e256022cc4","wss://spatia-arcana.com/","root","bc02e0a6c0f01ad9cb57a2b0f8ef8241bc5ff979ce4452ce9e243de457756725"],["e","f323ac83cb00db8955a7e56cf2ea8b5a054af9d2db057ea1622c20aaf8cf7f86","wss://relay.primal.net/","reply","da19b5d291e06ed09ba545bc5366408dc82ba8c9e9f97d32ea8ea60f1f6cbfaa"],["p","bc02e0a6c0f01ad9cb57a2b0f8ef8241bc5ff979ce4452ce9e243de457756725","wss://eden.nostr.land/"],["p","da19b5d291e06ed09ba545bc5366408dc82ba8c9e9f97d32ea8ea60f1f6cbfaa","wss://relay.damus.io/"],["p","d3d74124ddfb5bdc61b8f18d17c3335bbb4f8c71182a35ee27314a49a4eb7b1d","wss://premium.primal.net/"],["p","d3d74124ddfb5bdc61b8f18d17c3335bbb4f8c71182a35ee27314a49a4eb7b1d","wss://premium.primal.net/"],["r","https://www.kamresearch.global/meshtastic/"]]}
