{"id":"dac0e22a467afc4ef31b15a76be499cfe76774283d2e2dd8c3ee969fab93c26f","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1782480303,"content":"https://image.nostr.build/cfc19445925b8d3109657fec2ef003fc4c6b9b22c8178480732889d6bf0ef397.jpg\nThree years of carrying DamageBDD  and ECAI alone.\n\nThrough the noise.\nThrough the hype.\nThrough an industry drunk on probability, theatre, and endless approximation.\n\nStill carrying the mathematics.\n\nThis is probably the most Extremistan software on earth — not because it makes a wild claim for attention, but because it carries an extreme path of transformation that is already visible in implemented form.\n\nFrom verification-based development,\nto implemented ECAI search,\nto cryptographic memory,\nto the horizon of resurrection tech.\n\nThat is not a normal claim.\nThat is not a Mediocristan claim.\nThat is an Extremistan claim.\n\nBut the weight of it does not come from marketing.\nIt comes from mathematics.\n\nThe same mathematics no one wants to acknowledge directly,\nbut everyone already sees in Bitcoin.\n\nBitcoin made one thing undeniable:\nproof matters.\nfinality matters.\nverification matters.\n\nDamageBDD carries the audit trail.\nECAI carries the geometry.\nBitcoin carries the witness.\n\nSo yes, the claim is extreme.\nBecause the transformation is extreme.\nAnd the deeper truth is this:\n\nWhat people tolerate in money today,\nthey will eventually have to face in software, knowledge, and intelligence tomorrow.\n\nProof beats prediction.\nFinality beats narrative.\nAnd what begins as search does not end at search.\n\n#DamageBDD #ECAI #Bitcoin #Extremistan #Verification #Mathematics #ProofNotVibes #EllipticCurves #Search #ResurrectionTech #Finality #BuildInSilence","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://image.nostr.build/cfc19445925b8d3109657fec..."],["t","DamageBDD"],["t","damagebdd"],["t","ECAI"],["t","ecai"],["t","Bitcoin"],["t","bitcoin"],["t","Extremistan"],["t","extremistan"],["t","Verification"],["t","verification"],["t","Mathematics"],["t","mathematics"],["t","ProofNotVibes"],["t","proofnotvibes"],["t","EllipticCurves"],["t","ellipticcurves"],["t","Search"],["t","search"],["t","ResurrectionTech"],["t","resurrectiontech"],["t","Finality"],["t","finality"],["t","BuildInSilence"],["t","buildinsilence"],["r","https://image.nostr.build/cfc19445925b8d3109657fec2ef003fc4c6b9b22c8178480732889d6bf0ef397.jpg"],["imeta","url https://image.nostr.build/cfc19445925b8d3109657fec2ef003fc4c6b9b22c8178480732889d6bf0ef397.jpg","x 82102ff0d7de91d9daadcd3295cfdc4b863441d8212539f9ba6ad718a6e700b1","size 188397","m image/jpeg","dim 1055x1491","blurhash ^38#7{^*00NdM{D%rB_4IVD$t7Rj4m9GWCxtt7tR9v8_%L-=RjRP00M|_3kCRit7%$MxkCV@oftRDh-;xuM{xvRi_NjZITt7WAWBtRWBkDj[M{tR","ox 82102ff0d7de91d9daadcd3295cfdc4b863441d8212539f9ba6ad718a6e700b1","alt "]]}
