{"id":"b2fc4374a4f1e95be832d702668f9406309b469ca9082b5db396b1df85fffab1","pubkey":"100792ddfd28dc5bee3db19d2eff4ef94da236363b607d70f116a685510af1b2","created_at":1782477373,"content":"GM\n\nTime is the scarcest thing we have. \n\n18 summers with your kids. We make them count in our house. \n\nJust finished a helluva road trip stacking memories. \n\nIf we don't ever meet in person it's not because I don't want to go to Bitcoin conferences, it's because I use every ounce of my time off to make memories with my family. \n\nWhen I leave the fiat mines I hope to meet you in person \n\n\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/c9ad4d307f05e646981ed445aeb470b7e003e36f7c3647d70b776d051853cd80.jpg\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/cc8dd3df0b0b49ad874fdbecb4646300acf0d66e6a9e48d27ce2f9434a1ca4a1.jpg\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/a4010df4515b9b86d6f1e2f4555ddf1ead81599825a997041f09661abaa8739b.jpg\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/a1fc11d51414ed98913fdf926663ada9459167af45034b28091181fc56bbebb8.jpg","tags":[["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/c9ad4d307f05e646981ed445aeb470b7e003e36f7c3647d70b776d051853cd80.jpg","m jpeg","dim 4284.0x5712.0"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/cc8dd3df0b0b49ad874fdbecb4646300acf0d66e6a9e48d27ce2f9434a1ca4a1.jpg","m jpeg","dim 1206.0x2232.0"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/a4010df4515b9b86d6f1e2f4555ddf1ead81599825a997041f09661abaa8739b.jpg","m jpeg","dim 5712.0x4284.0"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/a1fc11d51414ed98913fdf926663ada9459167af45034b28091181fc56bbebb8.jpg","m jpeg","dim 4032.0x3024.0"]]}
